# 🏫 KCC Smart Campus

KCC Smart Campus is a Python Flask-based digital campus assistant designed to help students access academic and campus-related information easily.

## 🚀 Features

* 🤖 Campus AI for basic student queries
* 📚 Subject-wise Notes & Syllabus
* 🎓 Student Login and Dashboard
* 📝 Examination Information
* 💰 Fee Information
* 🚨 Report an Issue
* 📖 Unit-wise academic resources
* 🔐 Session-based student login


